            "Previous work has used calibration methods to match the label distribution of the target task during inference of zero-shot setting \\citep{zhao2021calibrate, holtzman2021surface}. We also analyze if calibration is effective for meta-trained LMs by applying contextual calibration on T0-3B. Because we evaluate the zero-shot task generalization performance, we use the probability of the label given an empty string for calibration. As shown in Table \\ref{table:calibrate}, applying calibration \\textit{hurts} the performance of meta-trained LMs. \n",
